<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Paired <math id="A1.T7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>-test results - AITA.</figcaption>
<div id="A1.T7.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:397.5pt;height:89.1pt;vertical-align:-42.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-19.0pt,4.3pt) scale(0.912534764024302,0.912534764024302) ;">
